          ],
          "rationale": "The previous patch failed because the security witness did not pass. The issue was that the `toRealPath()` method was not being called on the `target` path, which could still allow path traversal. By ensuring both `root` and `target` are resolved to their real paths and checking if `target` starts with `root`, we prevent path traversal attacks."
